# Sustainable Production Methods<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
<br>
As part of our commitment to sustainability, we aim to incorporate environmentally friendly production methods throughout our manufacturing process.<br>
<br>
## Research Findings<br>
<br>
* The Ordinary emphasizes the importance of clinical formulations with integrity in their products. We can apply similar principles to our production methods.<br>
* Fashion Nova&#x27;s trend-first approach highlights the need for flexibility and adaptability in responding to changing market demands. This can be achieved by implementing sustainable materials sourcing strategies.<br>
<br>
## Proposed Production Methods<br>
<br>
1.  **Sustainable Materials Sourcing**: Implement a robust system for tracking and verifying the origin of all materials used in production.<br>
2.  **Closed-Loop Manufacturing**: Design our manufacturing processes to minimize waste and maximize recycling opportunities.<br>
3.  **Energy-Efficient Equipment**: Invest in energy-efficient equipment to reduce our carbon footprint.<br>
<br>
## Next Steps<br>
<br>
* Conduct further research on sustainable materials sourcing strategies and their implementation in the fashion industry.<br>
* Develop a detailed plan for implementing closed-loop manufacturing and energy-efficient equipment in our production processes.<br>
